// AUTO-GENERATED - do not hand-edit. See icon-overhaul session notes for the
// regeneration process (emoji-test.txt matching + Fluent Emoji tree lookup).
//
// The full pickable icon library: the curated ~194 lucideData.ts concepts
// (nice labels/keywords, key = the exact Lucide name already stored in
// Family.tokenIcon/Award.icon/Countdown.emoji - zero migration) PLUS every
// other non-skin-toned Unicode emoji Noto/Twemoji/Fluent-3D actually has art
// for (key = 'emoji_<codepoints>', label/keywords derived from the official
// Unicode name, category = the official Unicode group). `available` lists
// which of NOTO/TWEMOJI/FLUENT_3D this specific concept actually has a file
// for - Noto's own SVG export has no country flags at all, and a handful of
// very new (Unicode 15.1/16) emoji aren't in Twemoji yet; the picker hides
// unavailable style tabs per-icon instead of showing a broken image.

